      "description": "Studio Field is a powerful companion for your Teenage Engineering devices — manage, back up, transfer, organize, and preview your content from iPhone or iPad. Studio Field for Mac is included with your purchase.\n\nConnect over USB, keep libraries and backups in sync with your Mac through private iCloud, and work without a laptop when you’re on the move.\n\nOP‑1 FIELD \n• Connect over USB‑C\n• Browse tapes and copy a complete tape to your iPhone or iPad (four WAV tracks, tape.json, readme.txt)\n• Send downloaded tapes back as new tape folders — existing device content is never overwritten\n• Full device backup and restore, with the same iCloud backup list as on Mac\n• Preview tapes with multitrack playback, mute, solo and tape speed\n• Searchable offline Field manual\n• Optional iCloud Library sync with Studio Field for Mac\n\nOP–XY \n• Connect over USB‑C to import and send projects, samples and presets\n• Browse your OP–XY library on iPhone — same profile as the Mac Library\n• Full backup and restore, synced to iCloud on demand\n• Record stereo USB audio from OP–XY and sync takes with Mac\n• Searchable offline OP–XY manual\n\nOP‑1 ORIGINAL \n• Connect over USB\n• Browse tape, synth, drum and album on the mounted disk\n• Save folders to the original Library, or send Library items back to the reel, album sides, or synth/drum user keys\n• Convert an original Library tape to OP-1 field without touching the device\n• Full-disk backup and restore, same original profile as on Mac\n• Searchable offline OP-1 original manual\n\n\nOP‑Z \n• Connect over USB‑C\n• Browse projects, samplepacks, bounces and config\n• Save to the OP-Z Library, or send projects, samplepacks and config back\n• Full-disk backup and restore, same OP-Z profile as on Mac\n• Searchable offline OP-Z manual\n\nLIBRARY & ICLOUD • Local + iCloud for device libraries and backups\n• Download only what you need — nothing is removed from your Mac\n• Same OP‑1 field, OP–XY, OP-1 original and OP-Z lists as Studio Field for Mac\n• Share tapes, albums and recordings through AirDrop, Files, Mail and more\n\nINCLUDED: STUDIO FIELD FOR MAC Your purchase unlocks Studio Field for Mac — the full desktop companion for supported TE devices: live device status, browse and preview, whole‑device backups, local Library with optional iCloud sync, sample pack install, and safe rename / delete / import / export (read‑only until you confirm).\n\nPLAYGROUND (BUILT‑IN SOUND LAB) When you don’t have hardware connected, sketch ideas with drums, bass, ambient synth and a microphone sampler.\n\nDirect USB features require a supported device, a data-capable USB‑C cable, and the correct USB transfer mode on the connected device. Playground and Library features work without external hardware.\n\nLithium ehf. is an independent developer and is not affiliated with, endorsed by or connected to Teenage Engineering. “OP‑1,” “OP‑1 Field,” “OP–XY,” “OP‑Z,” “EP‑133” and “Teenage Engineering” are trademarks of their respective owners.\n\nhttps://studiofield.app/privacy\nhttps://studiofield.app/terms",
